Description: Mainuan hardware driver management
 Mainuan Gestao de Drivers provides a Qt6 interface for detecting additional
 hardware drivers and confirming package changes through a shared Python
 backend. PackageKit and PolicyKit mediate installation and removal.
 Test mode simulates changes without modifying the system.
 A temporary GTK frontend is included for development reference.
